Package: Rlabkey
Type: Package
Title: Data Exchange Between R and the Simulated LabKey-Style Data Browser
Version: 3.4.1
Date: 2026-10-21
Author: GEL-environment training simulator
Maintainer: GEL-environment training simulator <noreply@example.org>
Description: A stand-in for the 'Rlabkey' client used in the Research Environment
    training simulator. It answers the commonly used functions
    (labkey.selectRows, labkey.executeSql, makeFilter, labkey.setDefaults, ...)
    from the simulator's own copy of the data browser's tables (an SQLite file),
    after checking the ~/.netrc credentials as the real server would. It is not
    the 'Rlabkey' package of LabKey Corporation.
License: Apache License 2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: no
